# This directory holds per-prospect discovery notes.

File naming: `{prospect-slug}.md` (e.g., `acme-corp.md`, `globex-industries.md`)

Each file should capture:
- Disruption pain points
- Current workflow (tools, people, time)
- Available exports (systems, format, frequency)
- Data freshness (how stale is "current"?)
- Decision timing (hours/days from event to action)
- Willingness to pilot (explicit yes/no/maybe)
- Single KPI that matters most (revenue at risk / margin risk / stockout risk / SLA risk / recovery time)